body:
Ring of radius R, uniform λ, total charge q. On its axis at distance z:
E = (1/4πε₀) · qz / (R² + z²)^{3/2}
Recipe: dq = λ ds → dE → use symmetry → integrate.

id.body:
Cincin berjari-jari R, λ seragam, muatan total q. Pada sumbunya di jarak z:
E = (1/4πε₀) · qz / (R² + z²)^{3/2}
Resep: dq = λ ds → dE → pakai simetri → integralkan.
